      "value": "@{5adf8b31a2fe006ef1504f73|full_name}: The problem is, nobody reads the ToS, except paralegals and those who are extremely paranoid about their experience in VRChat. Also, mods never just ban whomever they want for no reason, but people send dozens if not hundreds of reports every single day, and devs can't hire a bigger team, so they can't possibly handle all the violations and focus on doing something different for once. These messages on the loading screen aren't targeted at anyone specifically, because they have to remind everyone, including new players, what they shouldn't be doing.",
      "viewerReactions": null
